  "body": "Set in one of Orewa's most desirable pockets, this freehold 255 sqm (approx.) corner site combines elevation, sunlight, and convenience in a sought-after location. With Auckland Council-approved Building Consent drawings already in place, you can start planning or building right away.\r\n\r\nThe proposed design showcases a modern two-level home of approx. 210 sqm, featuring open-plan living upstairs with seamless flow to sun-soaked decks, a master suite with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, plus a functional lower floor with three bedrooms and double garage - perfect for families or those seeking flexible spaces.\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\n\r\n- Freehold 255 sqm (approx.) corner section\r\n\r\n- Building Consent approved 210 sqm design\r\n\r\n- Elevated site with all-day sun and open outlook\r\n\r\n- Walking distance to Orewa Primary School\r\n\r\n- Few mins to Orewa Beach & Town Centre\r\n\r\n- Easy access to motorway & Silverdale shopping\r\n\r\nBuy the land and build your dream home in one of the fastest-growing and most sought-after coastal communities on Auckland's North Shore.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a builder looking for your next project or a home buyer wanting a ready-to-go package with BC in place, this site offers a rare turnkey opportunity in Orewa's prestigious neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nYour future home starts here - contact us today for full plans and design options.",
